 protections • Idaho Capital Sun","source":"https://idahocapitalsun.com/2026/05/14/repub/shifting-attitudes-on-menopause-drive-lawmakers-to-push-for-new-protections/?utm_source=newsletters.idahocapitalsun.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=daily-newsletter-template&_bhlid=0cf601708846b1eb72f4d78d39dc2aa2223fbc31","author":null,"published":"2026-05-14","created":"2026-07-08","description":"Menopause used to be taboo, but there has been a generational shift that has led to more legislation to support health care for women."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},